Prior art that informed the approach
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
An earlier iteration of this project was an MCP server (preserved at tag v0.1.0),
and its design was informed by surveying these. None of their code was used, and
the MCP has since been removed in favour of a skill.

  Hochfrequenz/sapgui.mcp          https://github.com/Hochfrequenz/sapgui.mcp
    Backend-routed MCP for SAP (COM desktop + Playwright WebGUI). Originally
    named as a fork baseline; in the end nothing was taken from it.

  mario-andreschak/mcp-sap-gui     https://github.com/mario-andreschak/mcp-sap-gui
  kts982/mcp-sap-gui               https://github.com/kts982/mcp-sap-gui
    Screenshot-driven and COM Scripting API approaches to SAP GUI automation.

  jfilak/sapcli                    https://github.com/jfilak/sapcli
    Headless ABAP/ADT tooling — the case for doing SAP work without a GUI.

  SAP/PyRFC                        https://github.com/SAP/PyRFC
    Used as a dependency of scripts/sap_rfc.py, installed from source by the
    user. Apache-2.0. Not vendored here.

